essary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Addendum  1 by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  2  RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 signals  736  to chromosome 17 signals  87  in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Results at or near the cutoff point  ranging from REMOVED_DATE   2 2  should be interpreted with caution  Addendum  2 by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL MARGIN INFERIOR   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL MARGIN DEEP   EXCISION PART D  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL MARGIN SUPERIOR   EXCISION PART E  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL MARGIN LATERAL   EXCISION PART F  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL MARGIN MEDIAL   EXCISI  report_end  , Unchecked.
