ches to within 0 2cm of the posterior margin  and is  2cm from the anterior margin  There is adjacent dense tan white irregular fibrous tissue  4 x 4 x 2cm  to the lateral side of the cavity  There is a similar 5 x 4 x 2cm firm tan white area at the medial aspect of the cavity  The remainder of the breast is composed of tan pink unremarkable fibrous tissue and abundant yellow tan fatty tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A  Cavity to nearest posterior margin  B  Anterior portion of cavity  C  Representative section from inferior portion of cavity  D  Additional tissue from anterior portion of cavity  E  Fibrous tissue lateral to cavity  F  Fibrous tissue medial to cavity  G  Two intact lymph nodes  Resident  PAUL N  STAATS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
