uring REMOVED_DATE x 6 0cm  The brown  wrinkled unremarkable areola measures 3 2cm in diameter and the brown  wrinkled inverted nipple measures REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  There is a scant amount of axillary tail on the lateral aspect  denoted by a suture  as per the surgeon  5 0 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm    The specimen is additionally received with a short suture denoting the superior aspect of the specimen  as per the surgeon  The specimen is inked for orientation as follows  anterior   blue  posterior   black  Upon sectioning  there is a white pink  firm cavity in the upper inner quadrant measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  filled with gritty packing material and located 0 5cm from the anterior margin and 3 1cm from the posterior margin  There is an ill defined fibrous  gritty area adjacent to the LIQ cavity  Further sectioning reveals an additional pink gray  smooth lined  puckered  firm area in the lower outer quadrant  possibly consistent with a previous biopsy site  3 0 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm    This area is focally abutting the posterior margin  and extending focally to abut the anterior margin  There is an ill defined  fibrous nodule   approximately REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm    located 0 5cm from the lower outer quadrant cavity  1 2cm from the anterior margin and 3 0cm from the posterior margin  The remaining cut surfaces consist of a dense  edematous  focally nodular fibrous tissue  approximately 50  of the cut surfaces   and yellow  lobulated adipose tissue  The scant amount of axillary tissue is dissected and palpated to reveal a single possible lymph node measuring 0 4cm in greatest dimension  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Previous biopsy site in upper inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Possible previous biopsy site in lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  is one section  cut in half to demonstrate posterior and anterior margin relation