imen is inked as follows  anterior   blue  posterior   black  superior   green  and inferior   yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm cavity  with a pink red to white shaggy lining  This cavity is consistent with previous biopsy site  The cavity extends to the anterior margin  comes within 0 1cm of the posterior margin  4 4cm of the lateral margin  0 5cm of the superior  and 0 6cm to the inferior and medial margins  The tissue surrounding the cavity consists of yellow  lobulated fat and white  rubbery fibrous tissue  No definite masses are identified  Representative sections are submitted sequentially from medial to lateral  with en face medial margin within block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and en face lateral margin within block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axilla sentinel node 981  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm yellow fatty tissue within which a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm tan pink ovoid lymph node is identified  The lymph node is bisected and submitted in its entirety in block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Michael R Tan  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Elena F Brachtel M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Review by Elena F Brachtel M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Review by Elena F Brachtel M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  SKIN  RIGHT BREAST   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA   SENTINEL   1 981   EXCISION , Unchecked.
