ow overexpression of HER 2 c erbB 2  See note  Note  These tests were developed and their performance characteristics determined by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  20 REMOVED_MONTH 01 at 16 44 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  sentinel node hot and blue  level 1   REMOVED_CASE_ID   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm reniform shaped lymph node which is serially sectioned to reveal a tan yellow cut surface with blue color  Specimen is bisected after trimming the surrounding fat and submitted as FX 1  now in cassette A  The remaining specimen is entirely submitted in cassette B  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  are four parts  Labeled  left breast lumpectomy  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of breast  which is oriented by a short suture  designating superior and a long suture  designating lateral  Also identified is a localization wire  which goes penetrates the specimen from lateral to medial posterior  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior black  posterior blue  medial red  and lateral orange  The specimen is serially sectioned from superior to inferior to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm tan white  ill demarcated  stellate shaped mass  which comes to 0 3cm from anterior resection margin  0 4cm from the inferior resection margin  0 6cm from the medial resection margin  1 3cm from lateral resection margin and 1 7cm from the posterior resection margin  Sections of the tumor including margins are submitted in cassettes C H  closest anterior resection margin in D  inferior margin in H   Labeled  final shaved margin  superior cavity  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm aggregate of fibrofatty tissue  which is entirely submitted in I J  Labeled  final shaved margin  inferior cavity  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm aggregate of fibrofatty tissue  which is entirely submitted in K M  Labeled  right costal margin  lipoma  is a REMOVED_DATE x 6 7x 1 2cm fibroadipose tissue  which contains REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm area  partially covered by tan white fibrous capsule  Cross sectioning the specimen reveals a tan yellow lobulated cut surface without hemorrhage or necrosis  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes N Q  Resident  Mari Mino  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LYMPH NODE  SENTINEL NODE  HOT AND BLUE  LEVEL 1  REMOVED_CASE_ID    THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  HEIKE VARNHOLT  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Joseph Misdraji  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE   SENTINEL  HOT   BLUE LEVEL 1  REMOVED_CASE_ID    PART B  BREAST  LEFT   LUMPECTOMY PART C  BREAST  LEFT SUPERIOR   FINAL SHAVED MARGIN PART D  BREAST  LEFT INFERIOR   FINAL SHAVED MARGIN PART E  SOFT TISSUE  RIGHT COSTAL MARGIN   EXCISION , Unchecked.
