at failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  04 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 08 33 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast  is a previously opened REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm fragment of breast containing a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fairly well circumscribed  hard  tan white nodule  less than 0 1cm from the inked surface  Representative frozen is as frozen section  1  and resubmitted in cassette H  The remainder is submitted in A through G  Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FXDX  1  RIGHT BREAST   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Max L  Goodman  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
